                <pb facs="0190" n="180" sameAs="frus:frus1941v06/pg180"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.6363/462: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-10-02T15:00:00-04:00">October 2, 1941—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 3:41 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>490. My 480, September 28, 11 p.m. The local representative of Standard Oil has
                    been informed that the Government has approved a decree setting up a national
                    oil pool committee in accordance with Department’s proposal and that the decree
                    will be published within the next few days.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
